# Gercek topcu aimed volley: ortak emir yolu ve normal simulation tick'i.
# Tum oyuncu ranged birlikleri hold fire; cephane farki ve duman kareleri sonradan incelenir.
# Tek volley vardir. Bu fixture reddedilen/double-click emirleri otomatik test ettigini iddia etmez.
new
lang ru
select champagne
expect ResolvedBattleCount 0
march
battle wait active 5
battle pause on
battle select 1 replace
battle select 2 add
battle formation line
battle fire hold
battle move -8 0
battle select 3 replace
battle formation column
battle move -10 10
battle select 4 replace
battle fire hold
battle move 14 -6
battle state 00-deployment
shot 00-start
battle pause off
battle wait arrived 45
battle wait volley-ready 30
expect BattleSelectionArrived True
expect BattleCanVolley True
battle pause on
battle state 01-before-shot-paused
shot 01-before-shot-paused
wait 0.75
battle state 02-pause-held
expect BattlePaused True
expect BattleHasOutcome False
shot 02-pause-held
battle pause off
battle wait volley-ready 5
battle state 03-before-accepted-order
battle volley
wait 0.12
battle pause on
battle state 04-early-clouds
expect BattlePaused True
expect BattleHasOutcome False
shot 04-early-clouds
wait 0.75
battle state 05-clouds-pause-held
shot 05-clouds-pause-held
battle pause off
wait 1.1
battle pause on
battle state 06-developed-clouds
expect BattlePaused True
shot 06-developed-clouds
battle pause off
wait 6.5
battle pause on
battle state 07-clouds-cleared-candidate
expect BattlePaused True
expect BattleHasOutcome False
shot 07-clouds-cleared-candidate
# Asagidaki kapanis gercek retreat/rapor aktarimidir; dogal zafer iddiasi yoktur.
retreat
accept
battle verify-return
expect BattleActive False
expect ResolvedBattleCount 1
state 08-campaign-return
shot 08-campaign-return
quit
